{
 "meta": {
  "retrieved_at": "2026-11-12",
  "source": "Drata Control Framework (DCF) as exposed by the Drata API/MCP (read-only): monitoring test -> DCF control(s) -> SOC 2 (TSC 2017) and ISO/IEC 27001:2022 requirements.",
  "test_id_semantics": "test_id = Drata testId (test template id), not a per-account instance id.",
  "notes": [
   "Drata has no per-test framework mapping: tests map to DCF controls, controls map to requirements; all tests of one control inherit the same requirements.",
   "Mappings reflect Drata defaults as observed on 2026-11-12; an account can customize control mappings, so prefer a live read when a Drata connection is available.",
   "Per-account test status (enabled/unused/disabled, pass/fail) is intentionally not stored here."
  ]
 },
